  "name": "Cavolo Nero Orecchiette",
  "subtitle": "Pasta with greens, ricotta, lemon, and toasted almonds",
  "description": "Orecchiette is tossed with tender cavolo nero, fragrant aromatics, creamy ricotta, bright lemon, and crunchy almonds.",
